+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Phase 4A.1 — Scoped Vault V2 helpers (streaming path). All inert unless
+# ``DLP_VAULT_V2_ENABLED`` / ``DLP_VAULT_V2_SHADOW`` are set; the legacy
+# unscoped vault path is used byte-for-byte when V2 is disabled.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
